            "review_title": "Review at Trailer Trash Tavern",
            "review_text": "Howdy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nBest Dive Bar in Saigon!\nNov 2025 • Solo\nSoulful, artistic, eclectic, unique. The vibes were amazing, the owner knows his sh*t and the cocktails are banging and cheap! do not sleep on this place. I was told they are very new but it was already full of patrons. Do yourself a favour and slip into this gem when Bui Vien becomes too obnoxious for you. Its a 1 min walk from the main walking street\nInsider tip:\nIf you can get a seat at the bar, dive in. You will meet people, i came alone but met many other travellers.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 28, 2025",
