            "review_text": "rbrech\nSilver Spring, Maryland561 contributions\n0\nNice new bar\nOct 2025 • Solo\nDucked into this comfortable nook on a stormy night. Saigon beer on tap and about 15 stools arranged on 3 sides of the bar, and another 5 or so looking out the front window to the street below. Newly opened, the place looks spare, nice, and great tunes playing. Highly recommend.\nWritten October 15, 2025",
